<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{.Name}} — FlashProxy status</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Response time through the proxy vs direct, per vantage, and scenario results for the FlashProxy {{.Name}} product." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{.SiteURL}}/{{.Package}}" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1117" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="FlashProxy Status" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{.Name}} — FlashProxy status" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Response time and scenario results for the FlashProxy {{.Name}} product, measured continuously." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{.SiteURL}}/{{.Package}}" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{.Name}} — FlashProxy status" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="head">
      <div class="brand"><a href="/" class="plain">flashproxy<span class="slash">/</span>status</a></div>
    </header>

    <nav class="subnav"><a href="/">&larr; Live status</a> &middot; <a href="/sla">100% Uptime SLA</a></nav>

    <section class="intro">
      <h1>{{.Name}}</h1>
      <p>Marked degraded when average response time stays above {{.DegradedMs}} ms for {{.DegradedForMin}} consecutive minutes on the best vantage.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="components single" id="pkg-card" data-pkg="{{.Package}}" aria-label="{{.Name}} status">
      <div class="comp" data-pkg="{{.Package}}">
        <div class="comp-top">
          <span class="comp-name">{{.Name}}</span>
          <span class="spacer"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="comp-bot"><span class="mid">marked degraded above {{.DegradedMs}} ms</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ul class="keys" aria-label="How to read the card">
      <li><span class="k">status</span> <i class="sq" data-status="operational"></i> operational <i class="sq" data-status="degraded"></i> degraded <i class="sq" data-status="down"></i> down <i class="sq" data-status="no_data"></i> no data</li>
      <li><span class="k">bars</span> one block per minute: <i class="sw" data-status="operational"></i> operational <i class="sw" data-status="degraded"></i> degraded <i class="sw" data-status="down"></i> down <i class="sw" data-status="no_data"></i> no data</li>
      <li><span class="k">empty</span> a block with no data is a real gap: a vantage down, connectivity lost, or no vantage running. The newest minute is dropped only while it is still filling in.</li>
      <li><span class="k">chips</span> <span class="vchip dim">vantage</span> dimmed by default; a click shows that vantage's bars <span class="vchip sel">vantage</span>; a click on the active chip clears it; a click on another chip switches.</li>
      <li><span class="k">split bar</span> <i class="bar split"><span class="half" data-status="operational"></span><span class="half van" data-status="degraded"></span></i> with a vantage selected: upper half = package status, lower half = that vantage's status (thin border).</li>
      <li><span class="k">degraded</span> "marked degraded above {{.DegradedMs}} ms": the package is degraded when its best vantage's average response time stays above {{.DegradedMs}} ms for {{.DegradedForMin}} consecutive minutes; one vantage above {{.DegradedMs}} ms is not enough on its own.</li>
      <li><span class="k">down</span> a minute in which no vantage can connect.</li>
      <li><span class="k">★</span> the star on a chip marks the best vantage (lowest latency), used for the package verdict.</li>
    </ul>

    <section class="metrics" id="detail" data-pkg="{{.Package}}" data-vantage="{{.DefaultVantage}}">
      <div class="metrics-head">
        <span>response time · via proxy vs direct</span>
        <span class="ranges" id="ranges">
          <button type="button" data-min="60" class="active" aria-pressed="true">60m</button>
          <button type="button" data-min="360" aria-pressed="false">6h</button>
          <button type="button" data-min="1440" aria-pressed="false">24h</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      {{if .Vantages}}
      <div class="vchips detail-chips" id="detail-vantages">
        {{range .Vantages}}<button type="button" class="vchip{{if .Best}} sel best{{end}}" data-v="{{.Vantage}}" aria-pressed="{{if .Best}}true{{else}}false{{end}}">{{if .Best}}★ {{end}}{{.Short}}</button>
        {{end}}
      </div>
      {{end}}
      <div class="chart-box" id="chart-box">
        <svg id="chart" viewBox="0 0 1000 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="Response time chart"></svg>
        <div class="chart-labels" id="chart-labels"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-legend" id="chart-legend">&nbsp;</div>
      <div class="scn-head">scenarios <span class="muted">· last 10 min · via proxy vs direct</span></div>
      <div id="scenarios" class="scenarios-grid"></div>
      <div class="detail-note" id="detail-note" hidden>Could not load the latest data. Retrying.</div>
    </section>

    <p class="inc-note"><a href="/incidents?package={{.Package}}">Past incidents for {{.Name}} &rarr;</a></p>

    <footer class="foot">
      synthetic probes &middot; <a href="/sla" class="plain">100% Uptime SLA</a> &middot; <a href="/incidents" class="plain">past incidents</a> &middot;
      <a href="https://github.com/flashproxy-web/flashproxy-sla">source</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
  <script src="/bars.js"></script>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
